The updated strategy introduces a smoothing factor to gradually adjust the actions, which can help in maintaining more consistent control. It also maintains the core logic of using thresholds for pole angle and angular velocity to determine when to apply corrective actions. This should further improve the stability and performance of the cart-pole system.
